% =============================================================================
% eigenius_related_work.bib
%
% Contemporary related work in applied formal reasoning for science and
% engineering. Companion to:
%
%   eigenius.bib           — actually cited by Eigenius papers/docs/guides
%   eigenius_additional.bib — system depends on but does not yet cite
%   eigenius_precursors.bib — philosophical / methodological lineage
%
% This file collects the references identified during the bibliographic
% review of "docs/references/Formal Methods in Scientific Reasoning.md".
% They cover ongoing efforts to apply formal ontologies, higher-order logic,
% type theory, and knowledge graphs to scientific and engineering domains —
% i.e. the contemporary landscape against which Eigenius positions itself.
%
% Where authorship or precise venue could not be determined unambiguously
% from the source survey, entries carry a `note` field flagging the
% provenance so a future bibliographic pass can verify them.
%
% Same key convention as the other three files: lowercase, descriptive,
% short.
% =============================================================================


